kyabs mchog dpal bzang po</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><note type="comment">Date of composition: dbang phyug gi lo smin drug can gyi zla ba'i dkar phyogs kyi tshes cu gsum (1397?).&#13;
It is yet to be determined whether this is a commentary  on the Mūla­madhyamaka­kārikā following the commentary of Candrakīrti, or a commentary on the Prasannapadā (ID:3724).&#13;
The colophon names a number of persons having requested the teaching, none of which has been identified so far.</note><relatedItem type="commentaryOn" target="work:3724"/><relatedItem type="commentaryOn" target="work:3715"/><idno type="APIS">5209</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work6845"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dbu ma la 'jug pa'i rgya cher bshad pa gsung rab rgya mtsho'i de kho na nyid rab tu gsal ba</title><title xml:lang="bo">དབུ་མ་ལ་འཇུག་པའི་རྒྱ་ཆེར་བཤད་པ་གསུང་རབ་རྒྱ་མཚོའི་དེ་ཁོ་ན་ཉིད་རབ་ཏུ་གསལ་བ</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1310-01-01">after 1310</date><author ref="person:4080">skyabs mchog dpal bzang po</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><idno type="APIS">6845</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work7934"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rgyud bla'i rnam bshad</title><title xml:lang="bo">རྒྱུད་བླའི་རྣམ་བཤད</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1330-01-01" notAfter="1450-12-31">after 1330 before 1450</date><author ref="person:4080">skyabs mchog dpal bzang po</author><note type="isExtant">False</note><note type="comment">See [ENNZCF55]: 68 and [BAQ9MH4T]: 348, n. 15 and 410.&#13;
Listed by A khu ching shes rab rgya mtsho in his Tho yig ([5RXEUKD9]: 524, No. 11367: [lo tsA pa skyabs mchog dpal bzang gi...] rgyud bla'i rnam bshad.</note><idno type="APIS">7934</idno></bibl></listBibl><listRelation><relation xml:id="rel5078" name="student-of" active="#person6596" passive="#person4080" type="positive"/><relation xml:id="rel5079" name="student-of" active="#person6756" passive="#person4080" type="positive"/><relation xml:id="rel6905" name="author-of" active="#person4080" passive="#work7934" type="positive"/><relation xml:id="rel991" name="author-of" active="#person4080" passive="#work5209" type="positive"><desc>Evidence: <ptr target="#ex76012024-09-1612-18-36"/><ptr target="#ex76012024-09-1612-39-18"/></desc></relation><relation xml:id="rel4236" name="author-of" active="#person4080" passive="#work6845" type="positive"/><relation xml:id="rel4591" name="student-of" active="#person4129" passive="#person4080" type="positive"/></listRelation></standOff><text>
